# Ford Granada Mk2 four-door saloon, 1977-1985.
#
# The 1977 Granada facelift: 4,620 mm long, 1,810 mm wide, 1,370 mm high,
# 2,766 mm wheelbase; 1.6-2.8 V6 petrol and a 2.1 diesel. The executive Ford of
# the late 1970s and early 1980s, and the standard police and ministerial car.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ford_Granada_(Europe)
#
# Colours: White, Red, Blue and Green are documented Ford colours of the period.
#
# Weight: 130 in total (white 38, red 34, blue 30, green 28).
#
# Speed 190 km/h; comfort 110/345 (line). Classes 2,3.
# Dates: 1977-1985 with a road tail to about 1995.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/ford-granada-mk2.blend. References:
# citycars/references/ford-granada-mk2/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia
# Commons.

